<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sejarah Kelas X: Corak Kehidupan Masyarakat Praaksara</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Plus Jakarta Sans', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        history: {
                            50: '#fffbeb',
                            100: '#fef3c7',
                            500: '#d97706',
                            700: '#b45309',
                            800: '#92400e',
                            900: '#78350f',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f1f1;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #d97706;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .tab-btn.active {
            background-color: #b45309;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-amber-50/40 text-slate-800 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- HEADER / NAVIGATION -->
    <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-900 via-amber-800 to-amber-900 text-white shadow-lg sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-500 p-2.5 rounded-xl text-amber-950 shadow-inner">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-monument text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">HistoriEdu Kelas X</h1>
                        <p class="text-xs text-amber-200">Corak Kehidupan Masyarakat Praaksara Indonesia</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Status Siswa Ringkas -->
                <div id="userBadge" class="hidden bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-600/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs md:text-sm flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-circle text-amber-400 text-lg"></i>
                    <div>
                        <span id="badgeName" class="font-semibold text-amber-100">Nama Siswa</span>
                        <span class="text-amber-300"> | </span>
                        <span id="badgeClass" class="text-amber-200">Kelas</span>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="editUserIdentity()" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-200 ml-2" title="Ubah Profil">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation Tabs -->
        <div class="bg-amber-950/80 border-t border-amber-800/60">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-2 sm:px-6 flex overflow-x-auto custom-scrollbar space-x-2 py-2">
                <button onclick="switchTab('presensi')" id="tab-presensi" class="tab-btn active px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-user"></i> 1. Presensi & Profil
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('materi')" id="tab-materi" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> 2. Materi Detail
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('rangkuman')" id="tab-rangkuman" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract"></i> 3. Rangkuman
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('latihan')" id="tab-latihan" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-ruler"></i> 4. Latihan Soal
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('kuis')" id="tab-kuis" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> 5. Kuis Evaluasi
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
        
        <!-- ALERT MESSAGE BOX -->
        <div id="alertBox" class="hidden mb-6 p-4 rounded-xl border shadow-md flex items-start justify-between transition-all">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <i id="alertIcon" class="text-xl"></i>
                <div id="alertContent" class="text-sm font-medium"></div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="closeAlert()" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 1: PRESENSI & IDENTITAS -->
        <section id="sec-presensi" class="tab-content space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-amber-100 p-6 md:p-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center mb-6">
                    <div class="inline-block p-3 bg-amber-100 rounded-full text-amber-800 mb-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card text-3xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Form Presensi Siswa</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Silakan isi data diri Anda terlebih dahulu sebelum memulai sesi pembelajaran.</p>
                </div>

                <form id="formPresensi" onsubmit="handlePresensiSubmit(event)" class="space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">Nama Lengkap Siswa *</label>
                        <input type="text" id="inputNama" required placeholder="Masukkan Nama Lengkap Anda" 
                            class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500 outline-none transition">
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">Kelas *</label>
                            <select id="inputKelas" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500 outline-none transition bg-white">
                                <option value="">-- Pilih Kelas --</option>
                                <option value="X-1">X-1</option>
                                <option value="X-2">X-2</option>
                                <option value="X-3">X-3</option>
                                <option value="X-4">X-4</option>
                                <option value="X-5">X-5</option>
                                <option value="X-6">X-6</option>
                                <option value="X-7">X-7</option>
                                <option value="X-8">X-8</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-700 mb-2">Status Kehadiran *</label>
                            <select id="inputKehadiran" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500 outline-none transition bg-white">
                                <option value="Hadir">Hadir</option>
                                <option value="Izin">Izin</option>
                                <option value="Sakit">Sakit</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-4">
                        <button type="submit" id="btnSubmitPresensi" class="w-full bg-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-800 text-white font-semibold py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
                            <span>Kirim Presensi & Mulai Belajar</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>

                <div id="presensiSuccessInfo" class="hidden mt-6 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-emerald-800 text-center space-y-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-2xl text-emerald-600"></i>
                    <p class="font-semibold text-base">Presensi Terdaftar!</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-emerald-700">Data Anda telah tersimpan di sistem. Anda dapat melanjutkan ke tab **Materi Detail**.</p>
                    <button onclick="switchTab('materi')" class="mt-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition">
                        Lanjut Ke Materi <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 2: MATERI DETAIL -->
        <section id="sec-materi" class="tab-content hidden space-y-8">
            <div class="bg-amber-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-md">
                <span class="bg-amber-700 text-amber-100 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Modul Pembelajaran Sejarah</span>
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-3">Corak Kehidupan Masyarakat Praaksara</h2>
                <p class="text-amber-100/90 text-sm md:text-base mt-2">Memahami perkembangan sosial, ekonomi, budaya, dan teknologi manusia purba di Indonesia berdasarkan kurun waktu dan pola huniannya.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Sub Navigasi Tahapan Praaksara -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                <a href="#paleo" class="bg-white hover:border-amber-500 border border-gray-200 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 p-3 rounded-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-person-hunting text-xl"></i></div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">1. Berburu Sederhana</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Paleolitikum</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a href="#meso" class="bg-white hover:border-amber-500 border border-gray-200 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 p-3 rounded-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-campground text-xl"></i></div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">2. Berburu Lanjut</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Mesolitikum</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a href="#neo" class="bg-white hover:border-amber-500 border border-gray-200 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 p-3 rounded-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-wheat-awn text-xl"></i></div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">3. Bercocok Tanam</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Neolitikum</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a href="#perundagian" class="bg-white hover:border-amber-500 border border-gray-200 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 p-3 rounded-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-hammer text-xl"></i></div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">4. Perundagian</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Megalitikum & Logam</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Detail Content Cards -->
            <div class="space-y-8">
                <!-- 1. Paleolitikum -->
                <div id="paleo" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 scroll-mt-24">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 border-b pb-4 mb-4">
                        <span class="bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Masa Berburu dan Mengumpulkan Makanan Tingkat Sederhana (Paleolitikum)</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            <p><strong>Pola Kehidupan (Sosial & Ekonomi):</strong> Masyarakat pada masa ini hidup sepenuhnya bergantung pada alam (food gathering). Mereka bergerak dalam kelompok kecil (10–15 orang) agar memudahkan mobilitas pencarian makanan.</p>
                            <p><strong>Pola Hunian:</strong> bersifat <em>Nomaden</em> ( berpindah-pindah tempat) mengikuti ketersediaan hewan buruan dan sumber air di hutan atau padang rumput.</p>
                            <p><strong>Teknologi & Tools:</strong> Alat-alat berbahan batu kasar, tulang, dan tanduk hewan. Karakteristik utama belum dihaluskan.</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside bg-amber-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-1 text-xs md:text-sm text-amber-900">
                                <li><strong>Kapak Perimbas (Chopper):</strong> Untuk memotong kayu dan menguliti binatang.</li>
                                <li><strong>Kapak Penetak & Pahat Genggam:</strong> Alat batu masif kasar.</li>
                                <li><strong>Flakes (Alat Serpih):</strong> Menguliti dan mengiris daging buruan.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p><strong>Jenis Manusia Purba:</strong> <em>Pitheadthropus erectus</em>, <em>Meganthropus paleojavanicus</em>.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-amber-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600 mr-2"></i>Ciri Utama Paleolitikum</h4>
                                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-amber-950">
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Tergantung murni pada alam (Food Gathering)</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Tempat tinggal Nomaden</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Alat batu masih sangat kasar</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Belum mengenal pembagian kerja secara kompleks</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. Mesolitikum -->
                <div id="meso" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 scroll-mt-24">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 border-b pb-4 mb-4">
                        <span class="bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Masa Berburu dan Mengumpulkan Makanan Tingkat Lanjut (Mesolitikum)</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            <p><strong>Pola Kehidupan:</strong> Mulai mengenal pembagian kerja sederhana. Laki-laki berburu hewan besar, wanita tinggal di gua mengumpulkan tumbuh-tumbuhan dan mengasuh anak.</p>
                            <p><strong>Pola Hunian:</strong> <em>Semi-Sedenter</em> (menetap sementara). Mereka tinggal di gua-gua payung (<em>Abris Sous Roche</em>) dan di pinggir pantai.</p>
                            <p><strong>Hasil Budaya Khas:</strong></p>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                                <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-amber-100">
                                    <h5 class="font-bold text-xs text-amber-900">Kjökkenmödding</h5>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Fosil tumpukan sampah dapur berupa kulit kerang dan siput yang menggunung di sepanjang pantai timur Sumatra.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-amber-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-amber-100">
                                    <h5 class="font-bold text-xs text-amber-900">Abris Sous Roche</h5>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Gua tebing batu kapur yang digunakan sebagai tempat tinggal sementara serta perlindungan dari cuaca dan hewan buas.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p><strong>Kepercayaan & Seni:</strong> Mulai muncul lukisan dinding gua (tangan berwarna merah di Gua Leang-Leang, Maros) sebagai bentuk simbol penghormatan nenek moyang dan ritual perburuan.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-amber-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-skull mr-2 text-amber-600"></i>Ciri Utama Mesolitikum</h4>
                                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-amber-950">
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Menetap sementara di gua (Abris Sous Roche)</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Terdapat Kjökkenmödding</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Ditemukan Kapak Genggam Sumatra (Pebble)</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Sudah ada penemuan awal api & seni gua</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. Neolitikum -->
                <div id="neo" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 scroll-mt-24">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 border-b pb-4 mb-4">
                        <span class="bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Masa Bercocok Tanam (Neolitikum / Revolusi Praaksara)</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            <p><strong>Revolusi Kebudayaan:</strong> Terjadi perubahan besar dari <em>Food Gathering</em> (mengumpulkan makanan) menjadi <em>Food Producing</em> (memproduksi makanan sendiri melalui ladang dan ternak).</p>
                            <p><strong>Pola Hunian:</strong> <em>Sedenter</em> (menetap sepenuhnya). Mereka membangun pemukiman desa sederhana, membuat rumah panggung dari kayu dan bambu.</p>
                            <p><strong>Teknologi & Hasil Budaya:</strong> Alat batu sudah dihaluskan atau diupam dengan sangat rapi.</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside bg-amber-50/50 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-1 text-xs md:text-sm text-amber-900">
                                <li><strong>Kapak Persegi:</strong> Digunakan untuk berladang/mengerjakan kayu (tersebar di barat Indonesia).</li>
                                <li><strong>Kapak Lonjong:</strong> Berbentuk lonjong untuk bertani (tersebar di bagian timur Indonesia, Papua).</li>
                                <li><strong>Tembikar / Gerabah:</strong> Tempat menyimpan cadangan bahan makanan & wadah air.</li>
                                <li><strong>Perhiasan Batu & Tenunan Sederhana.</strong></li>
                            </ul>
                            <p><strong>Sistem Sosial:</strong> Terbentuk sistem kepemimpinan tradisional berbasis <em>Primus Inter Pares</em> (memilih pemimpin terkuat/terpandai di antara sesama).</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-amber-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling text-amber-600 mr-2"></i>Ciri Utama Neolitikum</h4>
                                <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-amber-950">
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Perubahan ke Food Producing</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Menetap permanen (Sedenter)</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Alat batu sudah dihaluskan (Kapak Persegi/Lonjong)</li>
                                    <li class="flex items-start"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-700 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i> Kepemimpinan Primus Inter Pares</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. Perundagian & Megalitikum -->
                <div id="perundagian" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 scroll-mt-24">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 border-b pb-4 mb-4">
                        <span class="bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Masa Perundagian & Tradisi Megalitikum</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            <p><strong>Masa Perundagian (Logam):</strong> Kata <em>Undagi</em> berarti seseorang yang memiliki keterampilan spesifik/teknis. Pada masa ini, masyarakat telah mampu mengolah bijih logam (Perunggu & Besi) menggunakan teknik pencetakan <em>Bivalve</em> (cetak setangkup) dan <em>A Cire Perdue</em> (cetak lilin).</p>
                            <p><strong>Hasil Kebudayaan Perundagian:</strong> Nekara perunggu, Moko, Kapak Corong (Kapak Sepatu), Candrasa, dan Arca Perunggu.</p>
                            
                            <hr class="my-3">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">Tradisi Megalitikum (Batu Besar)</h4>
                            <p>Kebudayaan mendirikan bangunan dari batu-batu besar yang berkaitan erat dengan kepercayaan **Animisme** (pemujaan roh nenek moyang) dan **Dinamisme** (kepercayaan pada benda bertuah).</p>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
                                <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
